          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Custom Turning Services Backed by Industry-Leading Equipment",
            "enable_h1_tag": false,
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "description": "<p>Our CNC turning services are ideal for creating precise, cylindrical components from metal parts like stainless steel, aluminum, and other raw materials. </p><h5><strong>What Is CNC Turning?</strong></h5><p>CNC turning is a manufacturing process where a rotating workpiece is shaped by a stationary cutting tool to produce cylindrical or conical components. Using computer-controlled machines, this method ensures high precision and repeatability, even for complex parts. CNC turning is ideal for creating shafts and rods, bushings and sleeves, threaded fittings, flanges and couplings, and custom cylindrical components.</p>",
            "desktop_content_position": "center-md",
            "desktop_content_alignment": "ta-left-md top-md",
